The petitioner is arrayed as accused/A4 in Crime No.14 of 2014, and is stated to have committed the following offences :
i) Sections 506(i), 366, 342, 417, 419, 420, 465, 468, 294(b), 341, 408, 471 r/w Section 120(B) of the Indian Penal Code, (IPC), 1860;
ii) Section 66 D of the Information Technology Act, 2000;
iii) Section 6(1) r/w Section 17 of the POCSO Act;
iv) Section 11(1), 11(2), 11(3), 11(4) r/w Section 12 of the POCSO Act, 2012, and Amendment Act, 2019;
v) Section 5(l), 5(j)(ii) r/w Section 6 of the POCSO Act;
